<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="JON" style="id">Jonah</book>
  <para style="h">Jonah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Jonah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Jonah</para>
  <para style="mt">Jonah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amittaia fapa Jona hnênah Lalpa thu a lo thleng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tho la, Ninevi khua, khawpui ropui takah chuan kal la, a chung thu tlângaupui rawh; an suahsualna chu ka hmaah a lo thleng chho ta si a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nimahsela, Jona chu Lalpa hma ata Tarsis-ah tlân bo tûrin a tho ta a; tin, Jopa khuaah a kal chhuk a, Tarsis pan tûr lawng a hmu a; tichuan, a kal man chu a pe a, Lalpa hma ata chu Tarsis pan tûrte nêna kal tûrin lawngah chuan a lût thla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpa chuan thli na tak mai tuifinriatah chuan a tîr a, tuifinriatah chuan thlipui nasa tak a tleh ta a; tichuan, lawng chu keh dâwn ang maiin a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tin, lawng mite chuan an hlau va, mi tinin mahni pathian an au ṭheuh va; lawng chu an tân a zân nân lawng chhûnga bungruate chu tuifinriatah chuan an paih chhuak ta a. Jona erawh chu lawng chhûngril berah a lo lût thla hman tawh a; a mu a, a lo muhîl dêr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutichuan, lawng hotu chu a hnênah a lo kal a, “Aw nang muhîl, eng tizia nge ni? Tho la, i Pathian ko rawh; i Pathian chuan kan boral loh nân min ngaihtuah mahna,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, “Hawh u, he thil ṭha lo kan chunga lo awm hi tu vâng nge ni tih kan hriat theih nân, ṭhum i vâwr ang u,” tiin an inbe hlawm a. Tichuan, ṭhum an vâwr a, ṭhum vâwr chu Jona chungah a tlu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, a hnênah chuan, “He thil ṭha lo kan chunga awm hi tu vâng nge ni, min hrilh rawh, kan ngên a che! I hnathawh eng nge ni? Khawi aṭanga lo kal nge i nih? Khawii rama mi nge i nih? Eng hnam mi nge i nih?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ani chuan an hnênah, “Hebrai mi ka ni a; tuifinriat leh khawmual siamtu Lalpa , vân Pathian chu ka hlau a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, mite chuan an hlau nasa ta êm êm a, a hnênah chuan, “Hei le, eng nge i lo tih ni?” an ti a; a hrilh tawh avângin, mite chuan Lalpa hma ata a tlân bo a ni tih an hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tichuan, a hnênah chuan, “Kan tân tuifinriat hi a fâwn loh nân i chungah eng nge kan tih ang?” an ti a, tuifinriat chu a fâwn nasa telh telh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, ani chuan an hnênah, “Min la kâng ula, tuifinriatah hian min theh chhuak rawh u; chutichuan, tuifinriat hi in tân a fâwn tawh lo vang; keimah avângin in chungah he thlipui na tak hi a tleh a ni tih ka hre si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, mite chuan khawmuala kîr tûrin an kar vak vak a; amaherawhchu, an thei lo va, tuifinriat chu an chungah a fâwn nasa telh telh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan Lalpa chu an au va, “Aw Lalpa , he mi nunna avâng hian min tiboral suh la, mi thiam thisen mawh kan chunga nghat lul lo tûrin kan ngên a che; aw Lalpa , nangin i duh anga i tih a ni si a,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, Jona chu an la kâng a, tuifinriatah chuan an theh chhuak ta a; tin, tuifinriat fâwn phûl bulh bulh chu a reh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tichuan, mite chuan Lalpa chu nasa takin an hlau ta a; Lalpa hnênah chuan inthawina an hlân a, thute an tiam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan Jona lem tûrin sangha lian tak a lo ruat tawh a; chu sangha kawchhûngah chuan Jona chu ni thum leh zan thum a awm a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Jona chu sangha kawchhûng aṭang chuan Lalpa a Pathian hnênah a ṭawngṭai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Heti hian a ti a: “Ka hrehawmna avângin Lalpa chu ka ko va, Anin mi chhâng a; Seol kawchhûng aṭangin ka au va, Nangin ka aw i hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thûk takah, tuifinriat chhûngrilah chuan nangin mi paih lût a, Tui tam tak chu ka vêlin a awm a; I tuifâwn leh i tui inchhawk zawng zawngte chuan mi vûr zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, ‘I mit hmuh ata paih chhuah ka ni a; Nimahsela, i biak in thianghlim lam ka hawi leh ang,’ ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuite chuan ka nunna chenin mi hual vêl a; Tui thûk chu ka vêlin a awm a; Hnimte chuan ka lû a tuam vêl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tlâng bul tâwp rêtahte chuan ka kal chhuk a; Lei chuan kumkhua atân a kalhnate chuan mi khâr khum a; Amaherawhchu, nangin, aw Lalpa ka Pathian, khuarkhurum ata chu ka nunna i la chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka nunna ka kawchhûnga a chauh lai chuan, Lalpa chu ka hre reng a; Ka ṭawngṭaina chu i biak in thianghlimah i hnên a lo thleng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thil lawi lo dâwt mai mai ngaihsaktute chuan, Anmahni ngilneihna chu an hawisan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan lâwmthu sawina aw nên i hnênah inthawina ka hlân ang a; Thu ka tiam tawh chu ka hlen ang. Chhandamna chu Lalpa ta a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan sangha chu a bia a, Jona chu khawmualah a law chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa thu chu Jona hnênah a lo thleng nawn leh a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tho la, Ninevi khua, khawpui ropui takah chuan kal la, thusawi tûr ka tuk che hi va tlângaupui rawh,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tichuan, Jona chu a tho va, Lalpa thu ang chuan Ninevi khuaah a kal ta a. Ninevi chu khawpui ropui tak, a zau zâwng ni thum kal a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jona chu ni khat kal chin khawpui chhûngah chuan a han lût ṭan phawt a, “Tûn achin ni sawmliah Ninevi hi tihboral a ni dâwn e,” tiin a au va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ninevi mite chuan Pathian an ring ta a; chaw nghei tûr tiin an puang a, an zînga a lian ber aṭanga a tê ber thlengin saiip puan an sin ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chûng thu chu Ninevi khaw lalber beng a lo thleng a, a lalṭhutphah aṭang chuan a tho va, a lal puan chu a hlîp thla a, saiip puan a sin a, vutah a ṭhu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalber leh a mi liante thupêkin lalber chuan Ninevi khaw chhûngah thu a puangin a chhuah a, “Mihring emaw, ran emaw, bâwng rual emaw, berâm rual emawte chuan eng mah tem suh se; ei tûr eiin tui pawh in suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihring leh rante chuan saiip puan sin zâwk sela, nasa takin Pathian au rawh se; a ni, mi tinin mahni kawng ṭha lo leh an kuta pâwngnêkna chu hawisan rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan boral loh nân Pathian chu kîrin, rilru lamlêtin, a thinrimna nasa tak aṭang chuan a inlamlêt lo vang tih tuin nge hria?” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, Pathianin an thiltihte chu enin, an kawng ṭha lo chu an hawisan tih a hmu a; an hnêna a sawi tawh, tih a tum thil ṭha lo chu Pathian chuan a lamlêt a, a ti ta lo a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, chu chuan Jona a tilungni lo ta êm êm a, a thinrim a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa hnênah chuan a ṭawngṭai a, “Aw Lalpa , ka ngên a che, hei hi kan rama ka la awm laia ka sawi kha a ni lo vem ni? Hei vâng hian Tarsis lamah ka tlân bo thuai a nih kha: nang zawng khawngaihna leh lainatnaa khat, thinnel, zahngai thei leh thil ṭha lo thlen lo tûra inlamlêt ṭhîn Pathian i ni tih ka hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, aw Lalpa , tûnah ka nunna hi mi lâksak tûrin ka ngên a che; keia tân hian dam aiin thih a ṭha zâwk si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan, “I thinrim hi i tidik em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tichuan, Jona chu khawpui ata chu a kal chhuak a, khawpui chhak lampangah chuan a ṭhu a, chutah chuan chhâwl bûk a sa a, khawpui chunga thil lo thleng tûr chu hmuh tumin a hnuai hlimah chuan a ṭhu ta reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa Pathian chuan ûm a lo ruat a, chu chu Jona chungah a zâmtîr a, a hrehawmna ata chhan chhuak tûra a lû zâr hliahtu atân. Chutichuan, Jona chu ûm avâng chuan a lâwm ta êm êm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, Pathianin a tûk khawfîng chah laiin sûlrûl a lo ruat a, chu chuan ûm chu a kher a, a lo vuai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, heti hi a ni a, ni a lo chhuah chuan Pathianin khawchhak thli lum a lo ruat a; tin, ni chuan Jona lû chu a em a, a thidang a, a tân chuan thih a dîl ta a, “Keia tân hian dam aiin thih a ṭha zâwk e,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tin, Pathian chuan Jona hnênah, “Ûm chungchâng thûa i thinrim hi i tidik em ni?” a ti a. Ani chuan, “Thih phah khawp hiala ka thinrim hi ka tidik a ni,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa chuan, “I hahpui loh, i ṭhantîr pawh ni hek lo, zan khat thila lo awma, zan khat thila boral leh ûm hi i lainat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ninevi khua, khawpui ropui tak, a chhûnga mi nuai khat leh sînghnih aia tam, an ding leh vei pawh thliar thei lote leh ran rual tam tak awmna hi ka khawngaih lo vang em ni?” a ti a.
  </para>
</usx>
